html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>152</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"已据本地DjVu提取文本核对对应段落；本节点的独立论证与核验边界见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\\subseteq A^2\">\\(\\to\\subseteq A^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in A^A\">\\(F\\in A^A\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CofinalFunctionalStrategy}\">\\(\\mathrm{CofinalFunctionalStrategy}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ReductionStrategy}\">\\(\\mathrm{ReductionStrategy}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e22d9797b2ac34d5\" href=\"?note=e22d9797b2ac34d5\" title=\"56-df-cofinal-functional-strategy\">56-df-cofinal-functional-strategy</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FunctionalNormalizingStrategy}\">\\(\\mathrm{FunctionalNormalizingStrategy}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ManyStepNormalizingStrategy}\">\\(\\mathrm{ManyStepNormalizingStrategy}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalizingStrategy}\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalizingStrategy}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9e7e983eeefce662\" href=\"?note=9e7e983eeefce662\" title=\"56-df-many-step-normalizing-strategy\">56-df-many-step-normalizing-strategy</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NF}\">\\(\\mathrm{NF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e295b2b3159f2b40\" href=\"?note=e295b2b3159f2b40\" title=\"56-df-normal-form\">56-df-normal-form</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CofinalFunctionalStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FunctionalNormalizingStrategy}(A,\\to,F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CofinalFunctionalStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FunctionalNormalizingStrategy}(A,\\to,F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\mathrm{ReductionStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\land\n\\mathrm{CofinalFunctionalStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\bigr)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NormalizingStrategy}(A,\\to,F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\mathrm{ReductionStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\land\n\\mathrm{CofinalFunctionalStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\bigr)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NormalizingStrategy}(A,\\to,F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：若a可归约到正规形b，共尾性给出b→*F<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#fn1\" id=\"fnref1\">[1]</a></sup>(a)。正规形没有出边，对该有限归约的长度归纳可知目标只能是b，故有限次迭代到达正规形。此证明不需要合流，也同时适用于一步和多步函数策略。原书将命题称为显然；这里完整展开其关键零步论证。</p>\n<p>来源的OCR页块序号按本地提取文本中的分页符编号，不等同于DjVu物理页码。本轮未作机器证明；计算性未编码。</p>\n<hr class=\"footnotes-sep\">\n<section class=\"footnotes\">\n<ol class=\"footnotes-list\">\n<li id=\"fn1\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p>n <a href=\"#fnref1\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</section>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-cofinal-functional-strategy","status":"resolved","id":"e22d9797b2ac34d5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-cofinal-functional-strategy]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-many-step-normalizing-strategy","status":"resolved","id":"9e7e983eeefce662","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-many-step-normalizing-strategy]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"e295b2b3159f2b40","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"