izingStrategy}(A,\\to,F).","display":true}],"bytes":1907,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-186","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-prop-cofinal-functional-strategy-normalizing.md]]"}],"outgoing":["e22d9797b2ac34d5","9e7e983eeefce662","e295b2b3159f2b40"]}